===Proper noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{lb|en|Islam}} A son of [[Ali]] and brother of [[Hassan]]; a [[martyr]], and [[Shi'a]] [[Imam]].
# {{given name|en|male|from=Arabic}} used by [[Muslim]]s, diminutive of {{m|ar|حسن||Hasan}} meaning ''[[good]]'' or ''[[handsome]]''.
# {{surname|en|[[Muslim]]|from=Arabic}} derived from the Arabic given name.

